{"version":1,"content":"<p>吳業坤（坤哥）與新婚譚嘉儀識於微時，近日2人遠赴加拿大，首度一同舉行兩場「坤歌•嘉音」限定演唱會，溫哥華及卡加利兩場演出全場爆滿。</p><p>2人相識15年默契十足，台上「零綵排」爆笑互動更是火花四濺，讓千名觀眾笑言像看了精彩棟篤笑。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T12:39:15.595982+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T12:14:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T13:37:35.690997+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T12:37:44.238445+00:00","content_hash":"92b55ec8e02e9e016a890581885405e4868ea82e405dfae9a011738b3cc8cfe5","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}